# The alternate UI bundle's outDirs. Nothing builds these any more — the
# alternate package was deleted on 2026-09-15 — and they stay listed because a
# checkout or a deployed box that predates the deletion still has one on disk,
# and an untracked `dist-2.0/` full of stale assets is noise the next reader
# does not need. Delete these two lines once no live checkout carries one.
dist-1.0/
dist-2.0/
# The graphify code graph (scripts/graphify-refresh.sh). Generated, tens of MB,
# and rebuilt nightly, so it is never committed. No trailing slash on purpose:
# in a worker lane this path is a SYMLINK to the launch project's directory, and
# `graphify-out/` would match only a directory — leaving the link untracked and
# every lane permanently dirty.
/graphify-out
/.vitest-json/
